      "text": "- we will implement as a Control Group :\n    ° the Limit \n\n- so on other words, we could say that\n  this particular Pod, because that's \n  a Kubernetes representation, can use :\n    ° 256 Mebibytes of Memory \n      as a Limit \n  and then \n    ° 100 millicores for cpu",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- we will implement as a Control Group :\n    ° the Limit \n\n- so on other words, we could say that\n  this particular Pod, because that's \n  a Kubernetes representation, can use :\n    ° 256 Mebibytes of Memory \n      as a Limit \n  and then \n    ° 100 millicores for cpu",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "created": 1790264543294,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
